...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit 화면 { class: ours }
team: HackerNews Team { class: ours }
openai: OpenAI API { class: ext }

user -> ui: 질문 입력 후 Enter
ui -> team: run(질문, stream=False)
team -> openai: 지시문 · 멤버 명단 · 질문\n+ 위임 스키마
openai -> team: delegate_task_to_member(\nhackernews-researcher, task)
